    "original_gold_lex_dicts": {
        "Id1": {
            "text": "Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense has 17000 members and their ground is Estadio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca located in Arapiraca. Their group is also known as \"Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense\". Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense play in the Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league with Vila Nova Futebol Clube as the champion."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The 17000 members club Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense has a full name of Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense and trains in the Est\u00e1dio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca ground in Arapiraca. They play in the Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league, which counts among previous champions the Vila Nova Futebol Clube."
